OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786020504
OL,3,CIran says Hormuz deal with Oman at
OL,4,C'final stage' as safe shipping route
OL,5,Cagreed
OL,7,FIran and Oman have agreed on the
OL,8,Fgeographical coordinates of a proposed
OL,9,Fsafe shipping route in the Strait of
OL,10,FHormuz, Iran's Foreign Ministry
OL,11,Fspokesman said on Wednesday.
OL,13,FA deal could potentially reopen the
OL,14,Fcritical waterway, ease pressure on
OL,15,Fthe world economy and help bring an
OL,16,Fend to the war.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
