FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786020504
OL,3,CIran says Hormuz deal with Oman at
OL,4,C'final stage' as safe shipping route
OL,5,Cagreed
OL,7,FThe agreement is in its "final stage"
OL,8,Fof drafting, Esmaeil Baghaei added,
OL,9,Fbut cautioned it hangs on whether
OL,10,F"certain third parties" obstruct the
OL,11,Fprocess.
OL,13,FOn Tuesday, US President Donald Trump
OL,14,Falso said a deal could be announced
OL,15,Fthis week.
OL,17,F"It could happen. Tomorrow or the next
OL,18,Fday," he told reporters. "A lot of
OL,19,Fprogress has been made. And they
OL,20,Fcalled me and they said, 'Please let's
OL,21,Ftalk.'"
OL,26,@yD@AOUzD@ZOU}D@GO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/7
