CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786020504
OL,3,CIran says Hormuz deal with Oman at
OL,4,C'final stage' as safe shipping route
OL,5,Cagreed
OL,7,FDespite Trump suggesting he is talking
OL,8,Fto Iran directly, Tehran has
OL,9,Fpersistently said it is talking solely
OL,10,Fwith Oman on the temporary arrangement.
OL,12,FThe agreement is likely to be
OL,13,Fcontingent on the US lifting its
OL,14,Fblockade on Iran's ports.
OL,16,FThe draft deal is waiting for final
OL,17,Fapproval from Iran's Supreme Leader
OL,18,FAyatollah Mojtaba Khamenei, two
OL,19,Fregional officials told The Associated
OL,20,FPress on Wednesday.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786020504
OL,3,CIran says Hormuz deal with Oman at
OL,4,C'final stage' as safe shipping route
OL,5,Cagreed
OL,7,FKhamenei is believed to have been
OL,8,Fwounded in the war's opening strikes
OL,9,Fand has not been seen in public since
OL,10,Fthen.
OL,12,FThe officials, who were briefed on the
OL,13,Fnegotiations, suggested the potential
OL,14,Fdeal is a temporary solution to the
OL,15,Fdispute over the strait.
OL,17,FThey said it is tied to an agreement
OL,18,Freached between the US and Iran in
OL,19,FJune that aimed at ending the fighting
OL,20,Fand reopening the waterway, but
OL,21,Fultimately collapsed.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786020504
OL,3,CIran says Hormuz deal with Oman at
OL,4,C'final stage' as safe shipping route
OL,5,Cagreed
OL,7,FThe officials said the potential deal
OL,8,Fwill pave the way for the US and Iran
OL,9,Fto resume negotiations on Tehran's
OL,10,Fnuclear program.
OL,12,FEarlier, they had said the potential
OL,13,Fagreement would have ships enter the
OL,14,FPersian Gulf through an Iranian-
OL,15,Fcontrolled route and exit through a
OL,16,Froute controlled by Oman.
OL,18,FService fees would be charged for
OL,19,Fproviding security and preserving the
OL,20,Fmaritime environment, the officials
OL,21,Fsaid.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30806
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786020504
OL,3,CIran says Hormuz deal with Oman at
OL,4,C'final stage' as safe shipping route
OL,5,Cagreed
OL,7,FThe US has said it is strongly opposed
OL,8,Fto any arrangement that would see Iran
OL,9,Fcharge fees.
OL,11,FThe US and Israel launched attacks in
OL,12,FFebruary, intending to topple Tehran's
OL,13,Fgovernment and end its nuclear
OL,14,Fprogramme.
OL,16,FClosure of the strait, through which a
OL,17,Ffifth of the world's traded oil and
OL,18,Fnatural gas once passed, has driven up
OL,19,Fthe price of fuel and basic goods,
OL,20,Froiling the global economy.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
