OL,3,CIran says Hormuz deal with Oman at
OL,4,C'final stage' as safe shipping route
OL,5,Cagreed
OL,7,FTrump is also under mounting pressure
OL,8,Fto end the war ahead of US
OL,9,Fcongressional elections.
